["Idhā Zulzilati Al-'Arđu Zilzālahā","Wa 'Akhrajati Al-'Arđu 'Athqālahā","Wa Qāla Al-'Insānu Mā Lahā","Yawma'idhin Tuĥaddithu 'Akhbārahā","Bi'anna Rabbaka 'Awĥá Lahā","Yawma'idhin Yaşduru An-Nāsu 'Ashtātāan Liyuraw 'A`mālahum","Faman Ya`mal Mithqāla Dharratin Khayrāan Yarahu","Wa Man Ya`mal Mithqāla Dharratin Sharrāan Yarahu"]
